From 0b7f91b3af290728f5d2afc21f846bfeb67cebd5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 09:43:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/5] feat(gitops): options for the setup steps on shared
 pickers (BYT-10423)

- WorkloadIdentityDialog: closeOnCreate closes after Create and a
  granted role instead of showing Done. A failed grant still shows Done.
- WorkloadIdentitySelect: describe and disabledReason let the caller
  set each identity's description and refuse identities it cannot use.
- DatabaseSelect: requireEnvironment lists a database with no
  environment as disabled, marked "No environment".

All three default to today's behavior.
